HANDOFF.md
README.md

# Python bytecode - regenerated on import, and it dirtied every diff
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime data, not code. catalog.db holds the real connector/validation
# state and the .duckdb files hold uploaded local data; both change on every
# run, so tracking them meant the tree was never clean. The schema is
# recreated by init_s2d_tables() / init_catalog_tables() on first start,
# so a fresh clone comes up empty rather than broken.
catalog.db
local_data_*.duckdb
